## Option A — C++23 chrono time-zone path: best semantic fit

**Claim**: The standard chrono time-zone API can convert `system_clock::now()` into local civil time through `current_zone()->to_local(...)`; then `year_month_day` can extract calendar fields.

**Evidence**: cppreference documents `current_zone()` as returning the local time zone and notes it is equivalent to `get_tzdb().current_zone()`:  
<https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/current_zone>

LLVM libc++ implements the forwarding function as:

**Evidence** ([source](https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/blob/025b9a27cf74c16e1b1467aa8d7423abaac8363b/libcxx/include/__chrono/tzdb_list.h#L87-L90)):

```cpp
[[nodiscard]] _LIBCPP_AVAILABILITY_TZDB _LIBCPP_HIDE_FROM_ABI inline const time_zone* locate_zone(string_view __name) {
  return get_tzdb().locate_zone(__name);
}

[[nodiscard]] _LIBCPP_AVAILABILITY_TZDB _LIBCPP_HIDE_FROM_ABI inline const time_zone* current_zone() {
  return get_tzdb().current_zone();
}
```

**Planning code**:

```cpp
#include <chrono>
#include <stdexcept>

Date today_local()
{
    using namespace std::chrono;

    const auto now = system_clock::now();

    // May throw std::runtime_error if tzdb/current zone is unavailable.
    const auto local_now = current_zone()->to_local(now);

    const year_month_day ymd{floor<days>(local_now)};

    return Date{
        static_cast<int>(ymd.year()),
        static_cast<unsigned>(ymd.month()),
        static_cast<unsigned>(ymd.day())
    };
}
```

**Caveats**:

- `std::chrono::current_zone()` may throw `std::runtime_error` if the time-zone database cannot be initialized; cppreference explicitly documents this exception.  
  Official doc: <https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/current_zone>
- Chrono time-zone support is standard since C++20, but deployed standard-library support can lag or be feature-gated.

**Evidence of implementation gating**: libc++ tests mark some current-zone tests as unavailable when timezone DB support is missing:

**Evidence** ([source](https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/blob/025b9a27cf74c16e1b1467aa8d7423abaac8363b/libcxx/test/std/time/time.zone/time.zone.db/time.zone.db.access/current_zone.pass.cpp#L12-L18)):

```cpp
